$ floe check far.yaml place.yaml shape.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
far.yaml:12:15: circle "a" sticks out of the 9353x300 canvas
far.yaml:13:15: label "A" sticks out of the 9353x300 canvas
far.yaml:19:15: circle "a" sticks out of the 400x300 canvas
far.yaml:20:15: label "A" sticks out of the 400x300 canvas
far.yaml:26:15: circle "a" sticks out of the 400x300 canvas
far.yaml:27:15: label "A" finds no room inside a and outside the other circles: make that area larger, or the text shorter
place.yaml:12:15: box "A" overlaps box "B"
place.yaml:15:11: AWS icons are not in $SAMPLE/.icons/aws; run "floe icons fetch aws" (downloads about 14MB from aws.amazon.com) and try again
place.yaml:25:15: raw SVG holds <script>, which it may not: write SVG's elements alone, without style, script or foreignObject
shape.yaml:12:67: value must be one of 'accent', 'good', 'warn', 'bad'
